### Summary

| Severity | Count | Top Issue |
|----------|-------|-----------|
| 🔴 Critical | 4 | LINQ chains in hot-path `FromPascalCase`/`Dehumanize` (3 sites); compound chain in `Pascalize` (4 intermediate strings per call) |
| 🟡 Moderate | 3 | `.ToLower()` culture-sensitive (2); `result[1..]` substring + concat (1); `params` array (1); unsealed classes (3) |

